OL,3,GNEWSANew delay to rail station entrance
OL,4,Awork completion
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the pavement along Bishopgate
OL,7,FStreet and sections of New Station
OL,8,FStreet had been opened, a problem with
OL,9,Fone of the lifts connecting the two had
OL,10,Fdelayed "essential" safety testing, a
OL,11,FLeeds City Council spokesperson said.
OL,13,F"We are working to resolve this as soon
OL,14,Fas possible so we can open the final
OL,15,Fparts of the scheme imminently," they
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
